{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess, but without the bureaucratic back-and-forth of <i>actually taking your turns</i>. There's no time to waste in this hectic re-imagining of your favorite checkered strategy game. Blink once, and it's Checkmate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/079544192c41e92ebe9e71514da176df.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every time you move a piece, you lose some mana- But every second, you gain some mana. Save it up to launch a 4-pronged assault, or move one piece at a time to keep your enemy on their toes! Both players move simultaneously, so quick-witted maneuvers are just as important as long-term strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single match can last anywhere between 10 seconds and 10 minutes. Hyper Chess features over a dozen unique Chess Sets to collect, several unique game modes to spice up the fun, and local/online multiplayer.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Battle of Wits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/5eeca1605ae038d782d753bdfaf2232973d65200.jpg"},{"name":"Lelouchian Gambit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/2085ce310f709323d6a326c2a83e806038bc5210.jpg"},{"name":"Three's Company","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/762bdb1d773f240dfa4dca9050e5fa9cbb676168.jpg"},{"name":"Scholar's Mate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/85e5e189fbebbd350bd522e284b9a28ba5f5ec5a.jpg"},{"name":"ICBM Gambit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/8705b4db46315eac44c20c5161ddee04b883d3a2.jpg"},{"name":"Cloud Opening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/6339c5cff16eeff6209beda556a8506021c00f8f.jpg"},{"name":"Checkmate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/56738e1f1e34fc6fe372dd4cfe5787362a101250.jpg"},{"name":"Checkmate?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/43e50de2a362329a025cffac803a146443a102bb.jpg"},{"name":"Stalemate?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/0efbfbcd9d5ccfb2bb922a5a05549f3123bd314f.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830210/4f731404aec49334ca0dc4a5ba0bacfebd2aaaa6.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830210?t=1754504045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830210?t=1754504045","capsu