 quick-witted maneuvers are just as important as long-term strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.poster.avif?t=1754504045\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.webm?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/extras/8e4d05c848dca87f5d6081609f3801c0.mp4?t=1754504045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single match can last anywhere between 10 seconds and 10 minutes. Hyper Chess features over a dozen unique Chess Sets to collect, several unique game modes to spice up the fun, and local/online multiplayer.</strong></p>","developers":["Grouch","SuitNtie"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830210/4ad978030c963ce9d64f03d65857e02bbc1eefd8/header.jpg?t=1754504045","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830210/1921963854/8bd0d954ce6010cb1679c182f7c40a0a8be06fb3/1754000051/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754001265","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830210/1921963854/8bd0d954ce6010cb1679c182f7c40a0a8be06fb3/1754000051/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754001265","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830210/1921963854/8bd0d954ce6010cb1679c182f7c40a0a8be06fb3/1754000051/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754001265","id":257175495,"name":"Hyper Chess Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175495/9dd2f2292f205ac4833